{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-plugin-proxy#card-zh","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-plugin-proxy","commit":"371306cdecad26dd28a4714e650bb91c65e0f77f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-proxy 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的全局代理插件，可在 Windows 系统代理与自定义 HTTP/HTTPS 地址之间切换，也能选择直连。它在主进程为 fetch 安装代理调度器，并设置子进程可继承的代理环境变量；浏览器侧提供侧边栏开关和设置卡片。主要功能包括维护 NO_PROXY 直连名单、实时显示代理状态、查询或切换代理，以及跟随系统代理变化。适合需要让 DSH 网络访问统一经代理，或临时恢复直连的用户。系统模式读取 Windows 用户代理，自定义模式需填写代理地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:156","lib/index.js:258","lib/client.js:226"]}
{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-plugin-proxy#card-en","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-plugin-proxy","commit":"371306cdecad26dd28a4714e650bb91c65e0f77f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-proxy routes DSH runtime fetch and child-process traffic through the Windows system proxy or a custom HTTP/HTTPS proxy. A web sidebar switch and settings card control the mode and bypass list; status tools report or toggle it. System mode reads Windows user settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:156","lib/index.js:258","lib/client.js:226"]}
